            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Ada Studio 1.0.0 — build 20261013</h2>
<ul>
<li>New Swift projects use the official AdaEngine GitHub dependency and remain portable between computers.</li>
<li>Opening existing Swift projects repairs local AdaEngine dependencies.</li>
<li>Preview, source navigation and web tooling find the SDK inside the installed Studio application.</li>
<li>Native exports and release resource loading no longer depend on the build computer's checkout.</li>
</ul>
